{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"pinball-game UI copy.description","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"pinball-game.copy.description","keys":["pinball-game.copy.description"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Main meja pinball kecil dan asli dalam pelayar anda. Lancarkan tiga bola, gunakan flipper kiri dan kanan, pukul bumpers dan simpan skor anda pada peranti ini. Tiada taruhan, hadiah atau perlawanan dalam talian.","record_id":"6acc5dc302d4df034e97a7aa41b8cf16795ef1d951c6049c260a914124900c38","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.5535464626249222,"source":"Play a small, original pinball table in your browser. Launch three balls, use the left and right flippers, hit bumpers and keep your score on this device. No bets, prizes or online match.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"cb8177b29951b62e358d7102f8cb9f276c7f5d13582605130b2989b4915ba4ad","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Main meja pinball kecil dan asli dalam pelayar anda. Lancarkan tiga bola, gunakan flipper kiri dan kanan, pukul bumpers dan simpan skor anda pada peranti ini. Tiada taruhan, hadiah atau perlawanan dalam talian.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"rlc-circuit-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Untuk model siri, Q = ω₀L/R dan lebar pita adalah R/(ZXQPH0000QXZπL). Untuk model sejajar, Q = R/(ω₀L) dan lebar pita adalah ZXQPH0001QXZ/(ZXQPH0002QXZπRC). Ini adalah hubungan resonans tunggal ideal.","record_id":"6a835d5f211e5becffbfae0b8213d210723560df03b0471b56c52eefa8268ec8","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.0843150226249918,"source":"For the series model, Q = ω₀L/R and bandwidth is R/(2πL). For the parallel model, Q = R/(ω₀L) and bandwidth is 1/(2πRC). These are ideal single-resonance relationships.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"d929113d31b49cd67fa0b70f4d3ec5403c3e4e89c98b4fcab359fb6074436c8a","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Untuk model siri, Q = ω₀L/R dan lebar pita adalah R/(2πL). Untuk model sejajar, Q = R/(ω₀L) dan lebar pita adalah 1/(2πRC). Ini adalah hubungan resonans tunggal ideal.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
